<title>USA: U.S. July 1 cattle/calf inventory--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. July 1 cattle/calf inventory--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA U.S. cattle inventory.</p>
<p> 1,000 head:			Pct-X   7/1/97  7/1/96-R 7/1/95-R</p>
<p> Total cattle/calves		 98  108,800  111,500  113,000</p>
<p> Cows/heifers that have calved   98   44,000   45,000   45,600</p>
<p> - Beef cows			   97   34,700   35,600   36,100</p>
<p> - Milk cows			   99    9,300    9,400    9,500</p>
